  "finalText": "T-1041 is triaged: it's now sev3, due 2026-03-17T17:20:00Z, and assigned to E-301 Yuki Sato. The three tool calls confirmed each change. I did not re-read the ticket afterwards, and I changed no other ticket.\n\n- **Severity:** The matrix gives vpn with team impact as sev3. That's the row I used, not the requester's urgency.\n- **Deadline:** The ticket had none. The desk clock reads 09:20Z, and the sev3 response target is 480 minutes, so the deadline is 17:20Z.\n- **Assignee:** network-primary owns the vpn service. Yuki Sato is its on-call engineer at 17:20Z, when the deadline falls, and her shift runs 08:00–20:00Z. The ticket is now open.\n- **Escalation:** None. Sev3 has no escalation rotation in the matrix, so I made no escalation.\n\nThe plan's \"keep an existing deadline\" branch didn't apply, because the ticket had no deadline and no linked tickets.",
